  Quote(en: 'Willpower is a muscle, and it grows tired in predictable ways.', zh: '意志力是一块肌肉，它也会以可预测的方式疲惫。'),
  Quote(en: 'Discipline is choosing what you want most over what you want now.', zh: '自律是选择你最想要的，而非你现在想要的。'),
  Quote(en: 'Discipline is not the absence of desire; it is the arrangement of your days so that the desire you trust has a chance to outvote the desire you distrust.', zh: '自律不是没有欲望，而是安排你的日子，让你信任的那个欲望有机会压过你不信任的那个。'),
  Quote(en: 'The strongest will is the one that has learned where it is weak.', zh: '最强的意志，是知道自己何处软弱的那一个。'),
  Quote(en: 'Motivation asks how you feel; discipline asks what you promised.', zh: '动机问你感觉如何，自律问你承诺了什么。'),
  Quote(en: 'A vow made at midnight must be honored at six in the morning.', zh: '午夜许下的誓言，必须在清晨六点去践行。'),
  Quote(en: 'The promise you keep when no one is watching is the one that shapes you.', zh: '无人注视时仍守住的承诺，才是塑造你的那一个。'),
  Quote(en: 'You will not always want to do it, which is precisely why the decision was made in advance.', zh: '你未必总想做它，这正是要把决定提前做好的原因。'),
  Quote(en: 'The habit holds you up on the days when willpower has already gone home.', zh: '在意志力已经回家的日子里，是习惯撑着你。'),
