  Quote(en: 'Motivation is a guest that arrives without notice and leaves without apology, so the sensible household builds a routine that runs on the days when no guest comes at all.', zh: '动机是不打招呼就来、不道歉就走的客人；明智的人家会备好一套日常，在没有客人来的日子里也能运转。'),
  Quote(en: 'Failure is not the opposite of success; it is one of its raw materials.', zh: '失败不是成功的对立面，而是成功的原料之一。'),
  Quote(en: 'Before you get up, write down how you fell.', zh: '起身之前，先写下你是怎样跌倒的。'),
