  Quote(en: 'Start the timer before the task, or the task will take the whole day.', zh: '开始任务前先按下计时器，否则它会耗掉一整天。'),
  Quote(en: 'Finish what you have started before starting three more graceful beginnings.', zh: '先把已开始的做完，别急着开三个更漂亮的新头。'),
  Quote(en: 'Punctuality is respect translated into minutes.', zh: '守时，是把尊重翻译成分钟。'),
  Quote(en: 'Rest belongs in the schedule, not in the reward column.', zh: '休息属于日程，不属于奖赏栏。'),
  Quote(en: 'The day is a container; fill it before it fills itself.', zh: '一天是个容器，趁它自己填满之前，你先装。'),
  Quote(en: 'Speed matters only after direction, otherwise it is just distance from where you meant to go.', zh: '方向之后才谈速度；否则速度只意味着离目标更远。'),
