  Quote(en: 'A goal without a deadline is only a preference.', zh: '没有期限的目标，只是一种偏好。'),
  Quote(en: 'Choose one target and the path appears; choose five and the fog stays.', zh: '选定一个目标，路就显形；选定五个，雾便不散。'),
