  Quote(en: 'Strategy is the art of deciding what you will not do.', zh: '战略是决定你什么不做的艺术。'),
  Quote(en: 'Every yes is a mortgage on the hours you have not met yet.', zh: '每一次答应，都是对尚未到来的小时的一笔抵押。'),
  Quote(en: 'Trade-offs are not obstacles to planning; they are the plan.', zh: '取舍不是计划的障碍，取舍就是计划。'),
  Quote(en: 'If everything is a priority, then nothing has been decided.', zh: '如果一切都是优先，那就什么也没决定。'),
  Quote(en: 'Choose the cost you are willing to pay, and most of the confusion lifts.', zh: '选定你愿意付出的代价，大半的困惑就散去了。'),
  Quote(en: 'The sharpest plan names the one thing that must happen this week.', zh: '最锋利的计划，点明本周必须发生的那一件事。'),
  Quote(en: 'A good goal pulls you forward; a bad one only makes you feel watched.', zh: '好目标向前拉你，坏目标只让你觉得被盯着。'),
