  Quote(en: 'You cannot have every good thing at once, but you can choose the order.', zh: '你无法同时拥有所有好事，但你能决定先后顺序。'),
  Quote(en: 'Measure the result, not the effort, and then let the effort follow.', zh: '衡量结果，而非努力，然后让努力跟上。'),
  Quote(en: 'A clear mind says what it will finish today and what it will leave.', zh: '清醒的头脑会说明今天完成什么、留下什么。'),
  Quote(en: 'Choose the thing you would regret skipping, and skip the rest without ceremony.', zh: '挑出你会后悔错过的那件事，其余的悄声略过。'),
  Quote(en: 'Half of a good plan is the list of things it refuses to include.', zh: '一份好计划的一半，是它拒绝纳入的清单。'),
  Quote(en: 'A short list of finished things is more persuasive than a long list of intended ones, and it is the short list that people eventually read.', zh: '一小份已完成的清单，比一大份打算做的清单更有说服力，而人们最终读的是那一小份。'),
  Quote(en: 'A thousand miles begins with one step under your foot.', zh: '千里之行，始于足下的一步。'),
  Quote(en: 'Little by little, the bird builds its nest.', zh: '小鸟一点一点地筑起自己的巢。'),
  Quote(en: 'One inch a day becomes three hundred inches in a year.', zh: '每天一寸，一年就是三百寸。'),
  Quote(en: 'Small improvements compound quietly, then arrive all at once like a season.', zh: '微小的改进静静复利，然后像季节一样一下到来。'),
  Quote(en: 'The minutes you cannot see are the ones building the result you can.', zh: '那些看不见的分钟，正在建造你看得见的结果。'),
  Quote(en: 'Do not despise the day of small things; that day does most of the work.', zh: '不要轻看微不足道的日子，大部分工作正是它做的。'),
  Quote(en: 'A day of small steps beats a month of grand intentions and no steps.', zh: '一天的小步，胜过一个月的大志加零步。'),
  Quote(en: 'Gather one stone at a time and eventually you have a wall.', zh: '一块一块地拾石头，最终你就有了墙。'),
  Quote(en: 'Every skill you admire in another person was paid for in repetitions you never saw, in mornings they did not enjoy, and in failures they chose not to describe at dinner.', zh: '你佩服的每一项技能，都是用你未曾见过的重复、他们并不享受的清晨、以及他们在饭桌上选择不提的失败换来的。'),
  Quote(en: 'Roughly right and finished beats perfectly planned and never begun.', zh: '粗糙但完成，胜过完美规划却从不开始。'),
  Quote(en: 'You cannot think your way into a new habit, but you can act your way into one, and the acting takes about as long as the thinking would have.', zh: '你无法靠想来养成新习惯，却能靠做来养成；而做所需的时间，大约与想所花的一样长。'),
  Quote(en: 'A habit is a decision that has stopped requiring a decision.', zh: '习惯，是一个不再需要做决定的决定。'),
];